{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41984","headline":"安福县秋吟寄陈锐秘书 · 李中","name":"安福县秋吟寄陈锐秘书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"县庭事简得余功，诗兴秋来不可穷。\n卧听寒蛬莎砌月，行冲落叶水村风。\n愁髭渐去人前白，醉面犹怜监里红。\n苦恨交亲多契阔，未知良会几时同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41984.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41984","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}